# Tracks from the panel (docs/15 S6, the lab switch on), with Macro as
# Sound 1 and Shapes as Sound 2: SEQ, PLAY/STOP; SEQ + white key 2 focuses
# track 2 (`watch 1`), whose Track page (SHIFT + key 2) routes it to Sound 2
# with KNOB2, which becomes current; MUTE held + white key 4 mutes track 4;
# the Set page (SHIFT + key 5): swing 60 % and 4 BPM faster; track 2's Clip
# page (SHIFT + key 3) at 1/2X, then 2X; SHIFT + key 6 turns the
# metronome on and off again; a MUTE tap mutes track 2.
--button 0.05:SEQ
--button 0.08:PLAY/STOP
--button 0.20:SEQ:0.1
--key 0.22:2:100:0.02
--button 0.40:SEL:0.05
--key 0.42:2:100:0.01
--turn 0.50:KNOB2:1
--key 0.80:13:100:0.3
--key 0.85:6:100:0.05
--button 1.20:SEL:0.05
--key 1.22:7:100:0.01
--turn 1.30:KNOB2:10
--turn 1.40:KNOB1:4
--button 1.60:SEL:0.05
--key 1.62:4:100:0.01
--turn 1.70:KNOB1:-2
--turn 2.60:KNOB1:4
--button 3.20:SEL:0.05
--key 3.22:9:100:0.01
--button 4.20:SEL:0.05
--key 4.22:9:100:0.01
--key 4.60:13:100:0.05
